                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a9253424-0a5b-3bbe-bac2-78abcc03280f",
                        "entry_id": "82e92870-cb9a-3b5e-b57a-cebbc09eacfe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "female equivalent of antykomunista (“anticommunist”)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine",
                            "form-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7d3c5c5b-21c6-488a-a98e-115680fedf28",
                                "sense_id": "a9253424-0a5b-3bbe-bac2-78abcc03280f",
                                "text": "Do aktywności w tej politycznej dziedzinie nakłoniła Wilsona jego kochanka, jedna z najbogatszych kobiet Teksasu i zagorzała antykomunistka - to Julia Roberts w nowym wcieleniu \"pretty woman\", piękna jak zawsze, choć odmieniona innym niż niegdyś upięciem blond włosów.",
                                "translation": "Wilson was coaxed to activity in this political field by his lover, one of the richest women of Texas and a staunch anticommunist, which is Julia Roberts in the new incarnation of \"pretty woman\", beautiful as always, even though she was sporting a more blond than usual hairstyle.",
                                "english": "Wilson was coaxed to activity in this political field by his lover, one of the richest women of Texas and a staunch anticommunist, which is Julia Roberts in the new incarnation of \"pretty woman\", beautiful as always, even though she was sporting a more blond than usual hairstyle."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e68339a0-957b-4ede-a341-1fcd5ddf1749",
                                "sense_id": "a9253424-0a5b-3bbe-bac2-78abcc03280f",
                                "text": "Rzeczywiście obok Banata siedziała Ewa Kantor z Ligi Polskich Rodzin. Nawet jako poseł znana nielicznym. Uchodzi za nieprzejednaną antykomunistkę i to by było na tyle.",
                                "translation": "Really sitting next to Banat was Ewa Kantor from The League of Polish Families. Even as a representative known by few. She passed for an implacable anticommunist and that would be enough.",
                                "english": "Really sitting next to Banat was Ewa Kantor from The League of Polish Families. Even as a representative known by few. She passed for an implacable anticommunist and that would be enough."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f6ea1d5f-f283-42c8-95fd-4264d799dd43",
                                "sense_id": "a9253424-0a5b-3bbe-bac2-78abcc03280f",
                                "text": "Dąbrowska była okropna. Niesympatyczna i zimna... I jeszcze brzydka. Co z tego, że była antykomunistką?",
                                "translation": "Dąbrowska was awful. Unkind and cold... and also ugly. What if it if she was an anticommunist?",
                                "english": "Dąbrowska was awful. Unkind and cold... and also ugly. What if it if she was an anticommunist?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
